    {
      "subId": "4133102",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Granny Ruoxin",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413310201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413310201": {
            "id": "413310201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "*sigh* The Lantern Rite is here once again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310202"
            ]
          },
          "413310202": {
            "id": "413310202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is there something on your mind, Granny Ruoxin?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310203"
            ]
          },
          "413310203": {
            "id": "413310203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Things should be festive and lively during the Lantern Rite, you know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310204"
            ]
          },
          "413310204": {
            "id": "413310204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "But in Qingce Village, the elderly are too old and the young are too young.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310205"
            ]
          },
          "413310205": {
            "id": "413310205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "All those young workers that have since flocked to the big city are either too busy and can't get time off work to celebrate the festival...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310206"
            ]
          },
          "413310206": {
            "id": "413310206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Or they're too far away to make it back home in time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310207"
            ]
          },
          "413310207": {
            "id": "413310207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Lantern Rite is a lively festival, it's a time when everyone should gather together to celebrate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310208"
            ]
          },
          "413310208": {
            "id": "413310208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Sure, I understand that it mustn't be easy for them either, but... *sigh* What about all the festivities?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310209"
            ]
          },
          "413310209": {
            "id": "413310209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Ugh, there's no use in complaining. That's no way to celebrate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310210"
            ]
          },
          "413310210": {
            "id": "413310210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "If you'd be so kind, I'm sure Ms. Bai could use a hand right about now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310211"
            ]
          },
          "413310211": {
            "id": "413310211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "The young lady said that she wanted to prepare a table full of food for everyone and is already hard at work on the preparations. I'm afraid that she won't be able to manage on her own...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310214"
            ]
          },
          "413310214": {
            "id": "413310214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Oh, thank you. You're too kind!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133103",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ms. Bai",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413310301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413310301": {
            "id": "413310301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ms. Bai",
            "text": "Seems we still need quite a few more ingredients...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310302"
            ]
          },
          "413310302": {
            "id": "413310302",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "<UNKNOWN>",
            "text": "Let me lend you a hand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310303"
            ]
          },
          "413310303": {
            "id": "413310303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ms. Bai",
            "text": "Huh? Oh, are you willing to help? You've come right on time! I was just starting to worry that we wouldn't manage to get all the ingredients.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310304"
            ]
          },
          "413310304": {
            "id": "413310304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ms. Bai",
            "text": "Let me see here... If you could, please help me get three chunks of Raw Meat and three pieces of Fowl.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310305"
            ]
          },
          "413310305": {
            "id": "413310305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ms. Bai",
            "text": "In the meantime, I'll think of a way to procure the other ingredients."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133105",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413310501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413310501": {
            "id": "413310501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ms. Bai",
            "text": "Great, that should be just enough. Ah yes, I'll also need you to help me go to Pops Kai and tell him to bring all the chairs and tables over.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310502"
            ]
          },
          "413310502": {
            "id": "413310502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ms. Bai",
            "text": "I plan on making lots of dishes, so if we wait too long to set up the tables, I'm afraid that the food might start getting cold."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133104",
      "subQuestName": "Help Ms. Bai prepare three servings of Raw Meat and Fowl each",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133106",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Pops Kai",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413310601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413310601": {
            "id": "413310601",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Pops Kai",
            "text": "Oh? Are you looking for me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310602"
            ]
          },
          "413310602": {
            "id": "413310602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We'll be needing the tables and chairs soon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310603"
            ]
          },
          "413310603": {
            "id": "413310603",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Pops Kai",
            "text": "Ah yes, the tables and chairs... I remember now. I've already prepared everything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310604"
            ]
          },
          "413310604": {
            "id": "413310604",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Pops Kai",
            "text": "Ah, but there should still be some more inside the shop. Alrighty, let's just bring them all out then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310605"
            ]
          },
          "413310605": {
            "id": "413310605",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Pops Kai",
            "text": "That should be enough tables and chairs for everybody.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310606"
            ]
          },
          "413310606": {
            "id": "413310606",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Pops Kai",
            "text": "I never expected that you'd come all the way here to help me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310607"
            ]
          },
          "413310607": {
            "id": "413310607",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm happy that I could help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310608"
            ]
          },
          "413310608": {
            "id": "413310608",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Pops Kai",
            "text": "#Heh! I must say that you're quite an extraordinary young {M#man}{F#lady}... But why haven't you gone home yet? Don't you plan on celebrating with your family?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310611"
            ]
          },
          "413310611": {
            "id": "413310611",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Pops Kai",
            "text": "No need to fret, I won't ask any further. I'm sure you have your reasons.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413310612"
            ]
          },
          "413310612": {
            "id": "413310612",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Pops Kai",
            "text": "If you're willing to celebrate the festival here, you're more than welcome to join us. As they say, the more the merrier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133107",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413310701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413310701": {
            "id": "413310701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "*sigh* Who knows when the young folks will finally get some time to rest..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133115",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413313701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413313701": {
            "id": "413313701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "With so many of us gathered together now, things are finally starting to feel like a festival.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313702"
            ]
          },
          "413313702": {
            "id": "413313702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Heh, now let's release this Xiao Lantern together, shall we?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313703"
            ]
          },
          "413313703": {
            "id": "413313703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "I wish everyone excellent health and good fortune in the coming year.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313704"
            ]
          },
          "413313704": {
            "id": "413313704",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "And may all the youngsters, wherever they are, see their dreams come true...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313705"
            ]
          },
          "413313705": {
            "id": "413313705",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ms. Bai",
            "text": "Alright Granny Ruoxin, if we wait any longer, the food I prepared will start getting cold.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313706"
            ]
          },
          "413313706": {
            "id": "413313706",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "Wow! Look at all the tasty food!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313707"
            ]
          },
          "413313707": {
            "id": "413313707",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Dongdong",
            "text": "Can we go now, Granny?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313708"
            ]
          },
          "413313708": {
            "id": "413313708",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Oh, children... Very well then, off you go now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313709"
            ]
          },
          "413313709": {
            "id": "413313709",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Won't you be joining them, Granny Ruoxin?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313710"
            ]
          },
          "413313710": {
            "id": "413313710",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Oh, me? I'm in no hurry. Besides, I'd like to watch the Xiao Lanterns awhile longer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313711"
            ]
          },
          "413313711": {
            "id": "413313711",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Which reminds me, these are for you, dear. It's my way of saying thank you for helping prepare all the festivities.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313712"
            ]
          },
          "413313712": {
            "id": "413313712",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Thank you, Granny Ruoxin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313713"
            ]
          },
          "413313713": {
            "id": "413313713",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "You're most welcome. From the looks of it, you must still be quite young. I imagine that all this running around must have left you quite tuckered out indeed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313714"
            ]
          },
          "413313714": {
            "id": "413313714",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Why don't you stay with us for a while and join the festivities?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413313715"
            ]
          },
          "413313715": {
            "id": "413313715",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "It's good to have a rest after rushing about all year long..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133109",
